      <div type="clause" n="16">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAtr">III Atr</ref> 16</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ þa myneteras þe inne wuda wyrceð oððe elles hwær, þæt þa bion heora feores scyldig, buton se cyning heom arian wille.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And moneyers who work in a wood or elsewhere shall forfeit their lives, unless the king is willing to pardon them.</ab>
      </div>
